        <BooleanAttribute Name="ExternalWritable" SystemDefined="true">true</BooleanAttribute>
        <BooleanAttribute Name="SetPoint" SystemDefined="true">true</BooleanAttribute>
      </AttributeList>
      <Comment>
        <MultiLanguageText Lang="en-US">Caller interface (C-115). Inputs (HopperLevelHigh/PlantRunning/FaultReset) are written by FC_ControlMain at integration; outputs (HopperBlockedAlarm/HopperBlockStopReq) are read there. The whole interface is RETAIN - immaterial for the re-driven inputs, deliberate for the two output latches (C-124 carve-out).</MultiLanguageText>
      </Comment>
      <Sections>
        <Section Name="None">
          <Member Name="HopperLevelHigh" Datatype="Bool" />
          <Member Name="PlantRunning" Datatype="Bool" />
          <Member Name="FaultReset" Datatype="Bool" />
          <Member Name="BlockedTimeThreshold" Datatype="Time" />
          <Member Name="ClearDebounceTime" Datatype="Time" />
          <Member Name="HopperBlockedAlarm" Datatype="Bool" />
          <Member Name="HopperBlockStopReq" Datatype="Bool" />
        </Section>
      </Sections>
    </Member>
    <Member Name="HighQualified" Datatype="Bool" Remanence="NonRetain" Accessibility="Public">
      <AttributeList>
        <BooleanAttribute Name="ExternalAccessible" SystemDefined="true">true</BooleanAttribute>
        <BooleanAttribute Name="ExternalVisible" SystemDefined="true">true</BooleanAttribute>
        <BooleanAttribute Name="ExternalWritable" SystemDefined="true">true</BooleanAttribute>
        <BooleanAttribute Name="SetPoint" SystemDefined="true">false</BooleanAttribute>
      </AttributeList>
      <Comment>
        <MultiLanguageText Lang="en-US">Debounced blockage-present latch: set the instant the hopper reads high, held through momentary sensor clears (chatter), cleared only once the hopper has read clear continuously for ClearDebounceTime (Q-HBA-02). Transient (non-retentive).</MultiLanguageText>
      </Comment>
    </Member>
    <Member Name="BlockActive" Datatype="Bool" Remanence="NonRetain" Accessibility="Public">
      <AttributeList>
        <BooleanAttribute Name="ExternalAccessible" SystemDefined="true">true</BooleanAttribute>
        <BooleanAttribute Name="ExternalVisible" SystemDefined="true">true</BooleanAttribute>
        <BooleanAttribute Name="ExternalWritable" SystemDefined="true">true</BooleanAttribute>
        <BooleanAttribute Name="SetPoint" SystemDefined="true">false</BooleanAttribute>
      </AttributeList>
      <Comment>
        <MultiLanguageText Lang="en-US">The persistence window accrues only while this is true: a qualified blockage AND the plant actually running (Q-HBA-04).</MultiLanguageText>
      </Comment>
    </Member>
    <Member Name="BlockActiveMem" Datatype="Bool" Remanence="NonRetain" Accessibility="Public">
      <AttributeList>
        <BooleanAttribute Name="ExternalAccessible" SystemDefined="true">true</BooleanAttribute>
        <BooleanAttribute Name="ExternalVisible" SystemDefined="true">true</BooleanAttribute>
        <BooleanAttribute Name="ExternalWritable" SystemDefined="true">true</BooleanAttribute>
        <BooleanAttribute Name="SetPoint" SystemDefined="true">false</BooleanAttribute>
      </AttributeList>
      <Comment>
        <MultiLanguageText Lang="en-US">Previous-scan BlockActive, for the constructed falling-edge (C-404).</MultiLanguageText>
      </Comment>
    </Member>
    <Member Name="PauseEdge" Datatype="Bool" Remanence="NonRetain" Accessibility="Public">
      <AttributeList>
        <BooleanAttribute Name="ExternalAccessible" SystemDefined="true">true</BooleanAttribute>
        <BooleanAttribute Name="ExternalVisible" SystemDefined="true">true</BooleanAttribute>
        <BooleanAttribute Name="ExternalWritable" SystemDefined="true">true</BooleanAttribute>
        <BooleanAttribute Name="SetPoint" SystemDefined="true">false</BooleanAttribute>
      </AttributeList>
      <Comment>
        <MultiLanguageText Lang="en-US">One-scan pulse when BlockActive falls (plant stop or genuine clear) - fires the T_SUB bank in NETWORK 4.</MultiLanguageText>
      </Comment>
    </Member>
    <Member Name="AccumulatedElapsed" Datatype="Time" Remanence="NonRetain" Accessibility="Public">
      <AttributeList>
        <BooleanAttribute Name="ExternalAccessible" SystemDefined="true">true</BooleanAttribute>
        <BooleanAttribute Name="ExternalVisible" SystemDefined="true">true</BooleanAttribute>
        <BooleanAttribute Name="ExternalWritable" SystemDefined="true">true</BooleanAttribute>
        <BooleanAttribute Name="SetPoint" SystemDefined="true">false</BooleanAttribute>
      </AttributeList>
      <Comment>
        <MultiLanguageText Lang="en-US">Cumulative high-and-running elapsed banked across plant-stop pauses (NEW-HBA-01). Two disjoint writers (NETWORK 3): reset to T#0S on a confirmed clear or FaultReset, banked up by each just-ended segment's elapsed on a plant-stop pause - never both in one scan. Transient (non-retentive); starts 0, so no first-scan trip. Replaces the former countdown RemainingTime (F1/F2/S1 fix, 2026-07-20).</MultiLanguageText>
      </Comment>
    </Member>
    <Member Name="CumulativeElapsed" Datatype="Time" Remanence="NonRetain" Accessibility="Public">
      <AttributeList>
        <BooleanAttribute Name="ExternalAccessible" SystemDefined="true">true</BooleanAttribute>
        <BooleanAttribute Name="ExternalVisible" SystemDefined="true">true</BooleanAttribute>
        <BooleanAttribute Name="ExternalWritable" SystemDefined="true">true</BooleanAttribute>
        <BooleanAttribute Name="SetPoint" SystemDefined="true">false</BooleanAttribute>
      </AttributeList>
      <Comment>
        <MultiLanguageText Lang="en-US">Live total = AccumulatedElapsed + PersistenceTimer.ET (NETWORK 4), compared against BlockedTimeThreshold to trip the alarm. Single-writer, derived each scan.</MultiLanguageText>
      </Comment>
    </Member>
    <Member Name="ZeroTime" Datatype="Time" Remanence="NonRetain" Accessibility="Public">
      <AttributeList>
        <BooleanAttribute Name="ExternalAccessible" SystemDefined="true">true</BooleanAttribute>
        <BooleanAttribute Name="ExternalVisible" SystemDefined="true">true</BooleanAttribute>
        <BooleanAttribute Name="ExternalWritable" SystemDefined="true">true</BooleanAttribute>
        <BooleanAttribute Name="SetPoint" SystemDefined="true">false</BooleanAttribute>
      </AttributeList>
      <Comment>
        <MultiLanguageText Lang="en-US">Constant zero (T#0S) source for the accumulator reset - TIA import rejects a bare Time literal as a MOVE operand, so the zero is held as an unwritten Time member (defaults to T#0S, never written). Non-retentive.</MultiLanguageText>
      </Comment>
    </Member>
    <Member Name="ClearDebounceTimer" Datatype="TON_TIME" Version="1.0" Remanence="NonRetain" Accessibility="Public">
      <AttributeList>
        <BooleanAttribute Name="ExternalAccessible" SystemDefined="true">true</BooleanAttribute>
