              <MultilingualTextItem ID="14" CompositionName="Items">
                <AttributeList>
                  <Culture>en-US</Culture>
                  <Text>Plain TON, never TONR (C-406), times the current contiguous high-and-running segment; FaultReset in its IN forces the current segment back to zero so a reset clears the in-progress time too (F1: reset is history-independent). CumulativeElapsed = AccumulatedElapsed (banked pauses) + this segment's live ET is the total cumulative high-and-running time, compared against BlockedTimeThreshold in NETWORK 5. PT is BlockedTimeThreshold only so a single contiguous segment's ET can itself reach the threshold; the trip is the comparison, not the timer's own Q.</Text>
                </AttributeList>
              </MultilingualTextItem>
            </ObjectList>
          </MultilingualText>
